{"id":"2021-zhejiang-17","year":2021,"subject":"数学","exam_type":"普通高考","paper":"浙江卷","regions":["浙江"],"question_no":17,"question_type":"fill_blank","stem":"已知平面向量 $\\vec{a}$，$\\vec{b}$，$\\vec{c}$（$\\vec{c}\\ne\\vec{0}$） 满足 $|\\vec{a}|=1$，$|\\vec{b}|=2$，$\\vec{a}\\cdot\\vec{b}=0$ 且 $(\\vec{a}-\\vec{b})\\cdot\\vec{c}=0$. 记向量 $\\vec{d}$ 在 $\\vec{a}$，$\\vec{b}$ 方向上的投影分别为 $x$，$y$， $\\vec{d}-\\vec{a}$ 在 $\\vec{c}$ 方向上的投影为 $z$，则 $x^2+y^2+z^2$ 的最小值为 $____$.","options":null,"answer":"$\\frac{2}{5}$","analysis":null,"knowledge_points":["投影向量","向量最值"],"difficulty":"难题","source":{"repository":"deekur/gaokaomath","file":"普通高考/2021/2021浙江.pdf","sha":"6eaa4467044e08aacde2fbcecf7e502748cd4397","license":"CC BY 4.0"},"stem_latex":"已知平面向量 \\(\\bs{a}\\)，\\(\\bs{b}\\)，\\(\\bs{c}\\)（\\(\\bs{c}\\ne\\bs{0}\\)）\n满足 \\(|\\bs{a}|=1\\)，\\(|\\bs{b}|=2\\)，\\(\\bs{a}\\cdot\\bs{b}=0\\) 且 \\((\\bs{a}-\\bs{b})\\cdot\\bs{c}=0\\).\n记向量 \\(\\bs{d}\\) 在 \\(\\bs{a}\\)，\\(\\bs{b}\\) 方向上的投影分别为 \\(x\\)，\\(y\\)，\n\\(\\bs{d}-\\bs{a}\\) 在 \\(\\bs{c}\\) 方向上的投影为 \\(z\\)，则\n\\(x^2+y^2+z^2\\) 的最小值为 \\(\\fillinblank{}\\).","options_latex":null,"answer_latex":"\\(\\dfrac{2}{5}\\)","needs_figure":false,"figure_refs":[],"figure_urls":[],"reference":{"repository":"DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation","file":"content/2021/zhejiang.tex","commit":"4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8","blob_sha":"526b5efd02cbb9fdf104a8f823915d497649ed2f","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},"verification":{"status":"verified","verified_at":"2026-08-31","methods":["upstream_pdf_git_blob_sha","pinned_reference_transcription","pinned_reference_answer_or_short_solution","secondary_answer_check","structural_validation"],"stem_sha256":"b96d87308bb6c5b3cbbaa53386c46cfb8e0c89f10123e4a46aef7ec294ba9c6d","answer_sha256":"dc35e8c60283adf3c9ff3d41739a35de375720b2912406272f88d491359711c2"}}
{"id":"2021-zhejiang-18","year":2021,"subject":"数学","exam_type":"普通高考","paper":"浙江卷","regions":["浙江"],"question_no":18,"question_type":"solution","stem":"设函数 $f(x)=\\sin x+\\cos x$（$x\\mathrm{i}n\\mathbb{R}$）. \\mathrm{i}tem 求函数 $y=\\bigl[f(x+\\tfrac{\\pi}{2})\\bigr]^2$ 的最小正周期； \\mathrm{i}tem 求函数 $y=f(x)f(x-\\tfrac{\\pi}{4})$ 在 $[0,\\frac{\\pi}{2}]$ 上的最大值. \\mathrm{e}nd{enumerate}","options":null,"answer":"（1）$\\pi$；（2）$1+\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}$","analysis":null,"knowledge_points":["三角函数图象与性质"],"difficulty":"中档","source":{"repository":"deekur/gaokaomath","file":"普通高考/2021/2021浙江.pdf","sha":"6eaa4467044e08aacde2fbcecf7e502748cd4397","license":"CC BY 4.0"},"stem_latex":"设函数 \\(f(x)=\\sin x+\\cos x\\)（\\(x\\in\\R\\)）.\n\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 求函数 \\(y=\\bigl[f(x+\\tfrac{\\pi}{2})\\bigr]^2\\) 的最小正周期；\n\n\\item 求函数 \\(y=f(x)f(x-\\tfrac{\\pi}{4})\\) 在 \\([0,\\frac{\\pi}{2}]\\) 上的最大值.\n\\end{enumerate}","options_latex":null,"answer_latex":"（1）$\\pi$；（2）$1+\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}$","needs_figure":false,"figure_refs":[],"figure_urls":[],"reference":{"repository":"DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation","file":"content/2021/zhejiang.tex","commit":"4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8","blob_sha":"526b5efd02cbb9fdf104a8f823915d497649ed2f","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},"verification":{"status":"verified","verified_at":"2026-08-31","methods":["upstream_pdf_git_blob_sha","pinned_reference_transcription","pinned_reference_answer_or_short_solution","secondary_answer_check","structural_validation"],"stem_sha256":"7f9d0569869a3821e0145c5aca163e07efc9d13d05b84eba45f0336aeb6b6533","answer_sha256":"9bdff7333753e382329f63abe783e5c3aa70f434e914c07bfde14359500b4436"}}
{"id":"2021-zhejiang-19","year":2021,"subject":"数学","exam_type":"普通高考","paper":"浙江卷","regions":["浙江"],"question_no":19,"question_type":"solution","stem":"如图，在四棱锥 $P-ABCD$ 中，底面 $ABCD$ 为平行四边形，$\\angle ABC=120^\\circ$， $AB=1$，$BC=4$，$PA=\\sqrt{15}$. 设 $M$，$N$ 分别为 $BC$，$PC$ 中点，$PD\\perp DC$，$PM\\perp MD$. \\mathrm{i}tem 证明：$AB\\perp PM$； \\mathrm{i}tem 求直线 $AN$ 与平面 $PDM$ 所成角的正弦值. \\mathrm{e}nd{enumerate} [图]","options":null,"answer":"（1）证明略；（2）$\\frac{\\sqrt{15}}6$","analysis":null,"knowledge_points":["线面角","空间向量"],"difficulty":"中档","needs_figure":true,"source":{"repository":"deekur/gaokaomath","file":"普通高考/2021/2021浙江.pdf","sha":"6eaa4467044e08aacde2fbcecf7e502748cd4397","license":"CC BY 4.0"},"stem_latex":"如图，在四棱锥 \\(P-ABCD\\) 中，底面 \\(ABCD\\) 为平行四边形，\\(\\angle ABC=120^\\circ\\)，\n\\(AB=1\\)，\\(BC=4\\)，\\(PA=\\sqrt{15}\\).\n设 \\(M\\)，\\(N\\) 分别为 \\(BC\\)，\\(PC\\) 中点，\\(PD\\perp DC\\)，\\(PM\\perp MD\\).\n\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 证明：\\(AB\\perp PM\\)；\n\n\\item 求直线 \\(AN\\) 与平面 \\(PDM\\) 所成角的正弦值.\n\\end{enumerate}\n\n\\bitmapfigure[max width=6.0cm]{img/2021/zhejiang/q19_fig1.png}","options_latex":null,"answer_latex":"（1）证明略；（2）$\\frac{\\sqrt{15}}6$","figure_refs":["img/2021/zhejiang/q19_fig1.png"],"figure_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation/4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8/img/2021/zhejiang/q19_fig1.png"],"reference":{"repository":"DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation","file":"content/2021/zhejiang.tex","commit":"4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8","blob_sha":"526b5efd02cbb9fdf104a8f823915d497649ed2f","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},"verification":{"status":"verified_with_figure_dependency","verified_at":"2026-08-31","methods":["upstream_pdf_git_blob_sha","pinned_reference_transcription","pinned_reference_answer_or_short_solution","secondary_answer_check","structural_validation"],"stem_sha256":"5211100f8ef41c7087b3fca07a7bba33b34860b05663e7bf0a4e7da72709d13c","answer_sha256":"a0ef858283bf60761275b22853e12fe