{"id":"2021-zhejiang-20","year":2021,"subject":"数学","exam_type":"普通高考","paper":"浙江卷","regions":["浙江"],"question_no":20,"question_type":"solution","stem":"已知数列 $\\{a_n\\}$ 前 $n$ 项和为 $S_n$，$a_1=-\\frac{9}{4}$，且 $4S_{n+1}=3S_n-9$. \\mathrm{i}tem 求数列 $\\{a_n\\}$ 的通项； \\mathrm{i}tem 设 $\\{b_n\\}$ 满足 $3b_n+(n-4)a_n=0$（$n\\mathrm{i}n\\mathbb{N}^*$），记其前 $n$ 项和为 $T_n$. 若 $T_n\\le\\lambda b_n$ 对任意 $n\\mathrm{i}n\\mathbb{N}^*$ 恒成立，求 $\\lambda$ 的取值范围. \\mathrm{e}nd{enumerate}","options":null,"answer":"（1）$a_n=-3(\\frac34)^n$；（2）$-3\\le\\lambda\\le1$","analysis":null,"knowledge_points":["数列递推","错位相减"],"difficulty":"中档","source":{"repository":"deekur/gaokaomath","file":"普通高考/2021/2021浙江.pdf","sha":"6eaa4467044e08aacde2fbcecf7e502748cd4397","license":"CC BY 4.0"},"stem_latex":"已知数列 \\(\\{a_n\\}\\) 前 \\(n\\) 项和为 \\(S_n\\)，\\(a_1=-\\frac{9}{4}\\)，且\n\\(4S_{n+1}=3S_n-9\\).\n\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 求数列 \\(\\{a_n\\}\\) 的通项；\n\n\\item 设 \\(\\{b_n\\}\\) 满足\n\\(3b_n+(n-4)a_n=0\\)（\\(n\\in\\N^*\\)），记其前 \\(n\\) 项和为 \\(T_n\\). 若\n\\(T_n\\le\\lambda b_n\\) 对任意 \\(n\\in\\N^*\\) 恒成立，求 \\(\\lambda\\) 的取值范围.\n\\end{enumerate}","options_latex":null,"answer_latex":"（1）$a_n=-3(\\frac34)^n$；（2）$-3\\le\\lambda\\le1$","needs_figure":false,"figure_refs":[],"figure_urls":[],"reference":{"repository":"DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation","file":"content/2021/zhejiang.tex","commit":"4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8","blob_sha":"526b5efd02cbb9fdf104a8f823915d497649ed2f","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},"verification":{"status":"verified","verified_at":"2026-08-31","methods":["upstream_pdf_git_blob_sha","pinned_reference_transcription","pinned_reference_answer_or_short_solution","secondary_answer_check","structural_validation"],"stem_sha256":"083d59ba6b5ebf73fcbf2fa4e081e3b6a4b9d8b73d9fa167d1d9f71b6ed2bb50","answer_sha256":"2399162aa999bdb9fb6b38804ab75a44170dd4d69d8f64e972f1f8b23a41de0e"}}
{"id":"2021-zhejiang-21","year":2021,"subject":"数学","exam_type":"普通高考","paper":"浙江卷","regions":["浙江"],"question_no":21,"question_type":"solution","stem":"如图，已知 $F$ 是抛物线 $y^2=2px$（$p>0$）的焦点，$M$ 为该抛物线准线与 $x$ 轴交点，且 $|MF|=2$. \\mathrm{i}tem 求抛物线方程； \\mathrm{i}tem 设过 $F$ 的直线交抛物线于 $A$，$B$，斜率为 $2$ 的直线 $l$ 与直线 $MA$，$MB$，$AB$，$x$ 轴依次交于 $P$，$Q$，$R$，$N$，且 $|RN|^2=|PN|\\cdot|QN|$，求直线 $l$ 在 $x$ 轴上的截距的范围. \\mathrm{e}nd{enumerate} [图]","options":null,"answer":"（1）$y^2=4x$；（2）见解析","analysis":null,"knowledge_points":["抛物线","直线与圆锥曲线","最值"],"difficulty":"难题","needs_figure":true,"source":{"repository":"deekur/gaokaomath","file":"普通高考/2021/2021浙江.pdf","sha":"6eaa4467044e08aacde2fbcecf7e502748cd4397","license":"CC BY 4.0"},"stem_latex":"如图，已知 \\(F\\) 是抛物线 \\(y^2=2px\\)（\\(p>0\\)）的焦点，\\(M\\) 为该抛物线准线与 \\(x\\) 轴交点，且 \\(|MF|=2\\).\n\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 求抛物线方程；\n\n\\item 设过 \\(F\\) 的直线交抛物线于 \\(A\\)，\\(B\\)，斜率为 \\(2\\) 的直线 \\(l\\) 与直线 \\(MA\\)，\\(MB\\)，\\(AB\\)，\\(x\\) 轴依次交于 \\(P\\)，\\(Q\\)，\\(R\\)，\\(N\\)，且 \\(|RN|^2=|PN|\\cdot|QN|\\)，求直线 \\(l\\) 在 \\(x\\) 轴上的截距的范围.\n\\end{enumerate}\n\n\\bitmapfigure[max width=6.0cm]{img/2021/zhejiang/q21_fig1.png}","options_latex":null,"answer_latex":"（1）$y^2=4x$；（2）见解析","figure_refs":["img/2021/zhejiang/q21_fig1.png"],"figure_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation/4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8/img/2021/zhejiang/q21_fig1.png"],"reference":{"repository":"DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation","file":"content/2021/zhejiang.tex","commit":"4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8","blob_sha":"526b5efd02cbb9fdf104a8f823915d497649ed2f","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},"verification":{"status":"verified_with_figure_dependency","verified_at":"2026-08-31","methods":["upstream_pdf_git_blob_sha","pinned_reference_transcription","pinned_reference_answer_or_short_solution","secondary_answer_check","structural_validation"],"stem_sha256":"e60199c07e2e8dd3789e81564174bcb225ed98dab94c27b1113a75d0b937c009","answer_