{"id":"2021-zhejiang-22","year":2021,"subject":"数学","exam_type":"普通高考","paper":"浙江卷","regions":["浙江"],"question_no":22,"question_type":"solution","stem":"设 $a$，$b\\mathrm{i}n\\mathbb{R}$，且 $a>1$，函数 $f(x)=a^x-bx+\\mathrm{e}^2$（$x\\mathrm{i}n\\mathbb{R}$）. \\mathrm{i}tem 求函数 $f(x)$ 的单调区间； \\mathrm{i}tem 若对任意 $b>2\\mathrm{e}^2$，函数 $f(x)$ 有两个不同零点，求 $a$ 的取值范围； \\mathrm{i}tem 当 $a=\\mathrm{e}$ 时，证明：对任意 $b>\\mathrm{e}^4$，函数 $f(x)$ 有两个不同零点 $x_1$，$x_2$，使 $x_2>\\frac{b\\ln b}{2\\mathrm{e}^2}x_1+\\frac{\\mathrm{e}^2}{b}$. \\mathrm{e}nd{enumerate}","options":null,"answer":"（1）$b\\le0$ 时递增；$b>0$ 时先减后增，分界点 $x=\\log_a\\frac{b}{\\ln a}$；（2）$1<a\\le e^2$；（3）证明略","analysis":null,"knowledge_points":["导数","函数零点","参数范围"],"difficulty":"难题","source":{"repository":"deekur/gaokaomath","file":"普通高考/2021/2021浙江.pdf","sha":"6eaa4467044e08aacde2fbcecf7e502748cd4397","license":"CC BY 4.0"},"stem_latex":"设 \\(a\\)，\\(b\\in\\R\\)，且 \\(a>1\\)，函数 \\(f(x)=a^x-bx+\\e^2\\)（\\(x\\in\\R\\)）.\n\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 求函数 \\(f(x)\\) 的单调区间；\n\n\\item 若对任意 \\(b>2\\e^2\\)，函数 \\(f(x)\\) 有两个不同零点，求 \\(a\\) 的取值范围；\n\n\\item 当 \\(a=\\e\\) 时，证明：对任意 \\(b>\\e^4\\)，函数 \\(f(x)\\) 有两个不同零点 \\(x_1\\)，\\(x_2\\)，使 \\(x_2>\\frac{b\\ln b}{2\\e^2}x_1+\\frac{\\e^2}{b}\\).\n\\end{enumerate}","options_latex":null,"answer_latex":"（1）$b\\le0$ 时递增；$b>0$ 时先减后增，分界点 $x=\\log_a\\frac{b}{\\ln a}$；（2）$1<a\\le e^2$；（3）证明略","needs_figure":false,"figure_refs":[],"figure_urls":[],"reference":{"repository":"DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation","file":"content/2021/zhejiang.tex","commit":"4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8","blob_sha":"526b5efd02cbb9fdf104a8f823915d497649ed2f","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},"verification":{"status":"verified","verified_at":"2026-08-31","methods":["upstream_pdf_git_blob_sha","pinned_reference_transcription","pinned_reference_answer_or_short_solution","secondary_answer_check","structural_validation"],"stem_sha256":"e7980fca2658f9db433a1271fc86650f1f1bb16827b74f9259dd70be5ba1862e","answer_sha256":"2aea